---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /resources/
title: Better Digital Experiences
description: Thoughtful articles on software, client experience, and intentional design for service-based businesses.
---
<div class="listing">
  <div class="listing-head">
    <span class="eyebrow">Resources</span>
    <h1>Better Digital Experiences</h1>
    <p>Thoughtful articles on software, client experience, and intentional design for service-based businesses.</p>
  </div>
  <ul class="article-list">
    {% for article in collections.resources | reverse %}
    <li class="article-card">
      <h3><a href="{{ article.url }}">{{ article.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p class="meta">{{ article.date | readableDate }}</p>
      <p>{{ article.data.description }}</p>
      <a class="readmore" href="{{ article.url }}">Read more</a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <aside class="shop-callout">
    <span class="eyebrow">My Picks</span>
    <h2>What I Actually Use</h2>
    <p>As a licensed esthetician, I get asked constantly what's actually in my routine. Here's the real list, skincare, serums, and the rest, updated as I try new things.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://shopmy.us/shop/aquapura" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Shop My Shelf</a>
  </aside>
</div>

{# Page-only styles: style.css is fetched from dbc-site-live at build time, so
   Resources-specific rules live here where the sync can't overwrite them. #}
<style>
  .shop-callout{
    max-width:680px;
    margin:64px auto 0;
    padding:44px 40px;
    background:var(--bg);
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-top:3px solid var(--clay);
    border-radius:3px;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .shop-callout .eyebrow{display:block;margin-bottom:.8em;}
  .shop-callout h2{
    font-family:var(--serif);
    color:var(--teal-deep);
    font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.1rem);
    margin:0 0 .5em;
  }
  .shop-callout p{
    max-width:520px;
    margin:0 auto 1.8em;
    color:var(--ink-soft);
    font-size:1.02rem;
    line-height:1.65;
  }
  @media(max-width:600px){
    .shop-callout{padding:36px 24px;margin-top:48px;}
  }
</style>
